  "title": "EgoMemReason and World-T3",
  "summary": "EgoMemReason establishes a benchmark for week-long egocentric video understanding through memory-driven reasoning, evaluating 17 methods across MLLMs and agentic frameworks. World-T3 introduces a camera-controlled video world model with a test-time training memory to consolidate past observations into dedicated model parameters, improving long-term memory efficiency.",
